title: International Relations
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: international_relations_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; international_relations_timer += 12;
card-image: img/international.jpg
max-visits: 4

As the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Republican**</span> Party emerges as a force for liberty and union, we have a chance to build relationships with foreign allies across the globe who share our ideals.

- @britain: Correspond with British Liberals and anti-slavery reformers. 
- @germany: Observe the German Forty-Eighters and support constitutionalism. 
- @haiti: Reaffirm ties with the Haitian Republic. 
- @france: Connect with French republicans fighting Bonapartist reaction.
- @france2: Connect with French republicans for there new Republic.
- @return: We do not need international contacts at the moment.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@britain
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; europe_relation += 1; moderate_strength += 1; liberal_strength += 2;

British liberals and abolitionist networks have long supported our cause. Sustaining these ties bolsters the party’s <span style="color: #9D2933;">**moderate wing**</span> and increases our standing abroad.

@germany
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; radical_strength += 1; germany_relation += 1; liberal_strength += 1;

The ideals of 1848 live on in the German states. Their exiled leaders now influence American politics, and we may, in turn, encourage their continued push for liberty in Europe.

@haiti
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; moderate_strength += 1; europe_relation += 1; liberal_strength += 1;

The Haitian Republic remains a beacon of freedom to many freedmen. Renewing symbolic ties strengthens our claim to moral leadership in the post-slavery world even if few in Congress care to notice.

@france
subtitle: -1 resources
view-if: year < 1870 or (year == 1870 and month <= 7)
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; moderate_strength += 1; europe_relation += 1; liberal_strength += 2; france_relation += 1;

Though France has slid back under imperial rule, republican sentiment remains strong. Our engagement signals that the Republican Party is part of a global democracy movement.

@france2
subtitle: year > 1870 or (year == 1870 and month > 7)
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; moderate_strength += 1; europe_relation += 1; liberal_strength += 2; france_relation += 1;

The French republicans have once again triumphed over the forces of monarchy. The Republican Party will support our oldest ally in the global fight for liberty.

@reduce

We do not need the international contacts at the moment.
